          },
          "description": "Set out 4 colors on the floo: red, blue, yellow, and green. When you hear a color called out, stomp or tap that color as fast as you can! Already standing on it? Tap again! You can use your hands, feet, elbows, knees—get creative and move your body! Start with slow rounds, then try medium or fast for a fun challenge. This movement game is great for indoors or outdoors, and it’s easy to set up with colored paper, pillows, or anything you have at home. Let's get moving!",
